<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:18.600
Say something.

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:21.690
-Come on.
-Please stop.

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:23.440
What are you doing?!

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:26.530
-Oh?
-You're resisting us?

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:28.740
Can't you see these?

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.990
We'll tell Gyobu-Danuki-sama on you.

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:39.080
Who cares. We've got plenty of time
to bully that kid.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:40.520
Let's go, Hiroto.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:41.850
Sure, Souma!

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:45.610
<i>All for the </i>tanuki<i>-sama!</i>

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:45.550
AKIRA TAKAMI

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:49.110
<i>Let us all stand together!</i>

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:50.180
CHAPTER 12

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:55.120
CAPITAL ANNIHILATED!
THE TERRIFYING YOKAI BEAST

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:58.980
Gimme Tanuki Soba.

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.310
Did you order Tanuki Soba?!

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.650
I-It was my usual, so I just...

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:07.650
Usual?!

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:09.030
A repeat offender!

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:13.280
1:20 PM. Arrested for
contempt against the <i>tanuki</i>!

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:18.120
Please put out the fire!

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.750
You're anti-<i>tanuki</i>, aren't you?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:23.710
A house like yours deserves to burn.

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:27.150
They say he's anti-<i>tanuki</i>.

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:29.860
Oh my, how awful.

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:33.680
The government should just make
a detention camp or something.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:38.810
<i>Currently, 5,001 people have been arrested</i>
<i>for breaking </i>tanuki<i> laws.</i>

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:40.930
<i>TANUKI</i> LAW HAS CHANGED!
ANTI-<i>TANUKI</i> DETENTION CAMPS TO BE BUILT

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:41.000
<i>Detention camps will be built
in various places.</i>

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:44.120
<i>Please be mindful of speech and conduct.</i>

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.770
You should be careful, too.
You always say one thing too much.

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:50.400
I believe you're referring to yourself.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:54.130
Saying I say one thing too much
is saying one thing too much.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:57.410
Why can't I worry about my husband?

00:03:57.410 --> 00:04:00.910
Do you have any idea
how careful I am at work?!

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:03.540
Don't think you're the only one!

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.440
That's enough, you two.

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:07.630
This is all the <i>tanuki</i>'s fault!

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:12.930
<i>Kitaro...</i>

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:28.750
Cat-sa--

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:37.160
You never called, so I was so worried...

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:38.370
It's all clear.

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:42.910
I never thought I'd have to act like
a prowler at my age.

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:45.330
This is tough on a drunk!

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:47.290
Um...

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.110
We were worried about you, Mana.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:53.720
Also, we needed to talk
about the resistance.

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:56.070
The <i>tanuki</i> are everywhere.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.260
Isn't Kitaro coming?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.890
Cat-san?

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:04.100
He hasn't contacted us since then.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:05.790
Could he have...?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:09.130
That would never happen to Kitaro.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:17.260
Found Daddy Eyeball.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:20.390
Everyone, you're all right...

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:21.870
Daddy Eyeball-san!

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:25.370
More importantly, Kitaro was...

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:29.400
Kitaro was turned to stone?

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.320
Because of me,

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:36.900
my only son was turned to stone...

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.310
Cat-san?

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:44.080
I'm not crying.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:46.350
What're we gonna do now?

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:49.230
We have to destroy
the Kaname Stone somehow.

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:53.280
Otherwise Japan really will become
the <i>tanuki</i>'s country.

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:55.150
Have you got a plan?

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:58.860
Listen...

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:01.870
<i>Yokai</i> who touch it turn to stone, right?

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:04.040
Wouldn't a human be all right then?

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:09.830
No, no. There's no guarantee that
being human means you'll be safe.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:12.130
It's worth trying, isn't it?

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:13.520
I'll do it.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.030
I told you, you can't.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:17.780
Then, is there another way?

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:20.780
Please let me do it!

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:25.060
Kitaro and you all have helped me
so many times until now.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:27.870
Now it's my turn to help you!

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:34.000
Very well.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:38.320
Let's all take
Mana-chan to the Kaname Stone.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.770
Wally Wall.

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:55.380
Is this it?

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:56.260
Yes.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:58.630
Everyone, you all know the danger?

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:04.300
A-whoop!

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:07.850
Wally Wall, you guard here.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:09.600
Wally Wall.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.610
What is it?

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:18.940
It appears that some <i>yokai</i> have entered
this underground world.

00:07:19.340 --> 00:07:21.680
They're headed for the Kaname Stone.

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:26.910
I doubt it's possible,
but Danichiro, defend the Kaname Stone.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:27.790
Yes, sir!

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:30.960
This way!

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:35.250
It's the <i>tanuki</i>!

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:38.690
Everyone! Those are Kitaro's friends!

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:41.680
I'm gonna mess you up later!

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:43.570
If there is a "later"!

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.330
Look out!

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.980
Leave this to me! Y'all go on ahead!

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:52.830
Thanks, Rollo Cloth!

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.920
Here I go!

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:57.770
A-whoop!

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:59.630
A-whoop! And a-whoop!

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:02.090
What a quick little loincloth!

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:03.740
A-whoosh!

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:07.810
Ya don't want me to
squeeze this guy to death, do ya?

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:09.770
Huh?

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:13.560
A-help me!

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:15.560
Torn like a rag...

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:18.710
Like you could beat me in strength.

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.380
Has he had enough?

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:23.720
This is perfect.
I'll make him my loincloth.

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:25.570
You go on ahead.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.390
-I'll catch up real quick.
-Wh-What are ya doin'?!

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:29.410
-Okay, let's go.
-Stop! Oh, it's warm.

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:34.060
Daddy Eyeball, are we there yet?
I'm tired of running.

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:35.440
Complaining already?!

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:37.480
I need more <i>sake</i>!

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:44.090
It looks like they beat Rollo Cloth.

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:47.800
Sand Witch, thanks for everything.

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:49.280
Old Man Crybaby!

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:51.770
What are you talking about?!

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:56.000
You still haven't paid me back for
the <i>sake</i> I bought you.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.420
Forget that.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.180
Paralysis Sand!

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:13.310
Sand Witch-san!

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:15.310
We'll have to go on ahead!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:18.130
I've caught up.

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.510
Dust Fan!

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:27.260
You want to fight me, old woman?

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:35.930
You old man!

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:43.840
Danichiro!

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:46.430
H-Help me!

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:48.180
Whatever.

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:51.410
I'm going after the others.

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:53.270
Everyone, let's go!

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:57.710
Oh no you don't!

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:02.840
Sand Drum!

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:05.840
<i>Chinchinchinapaiponasukai</i>

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:09.090
<i>Arichachinapapa
chinapuipui!</i>

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:23.130
What happened to all of you?

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:26.010
Th-Those guys are really strong!

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:31.680
They're almost at the Kaname Stone!
Plus, that Mana brat is with them!

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:32.410
What?!

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:35.390
The curse on the Kaname Stone
doesn't affect humans.

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:39.940
Wait! I've placed a curse on that girl.

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.260
Kitaro!

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.960
Cat-san!

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:09.420
Mana! Hurry and save Kitaro!

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:11.450
Okay!

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:17.580
Mana?

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:39.870
It's Gyobu-Danuki's curse.

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:43.790
Mana-chan!

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:53.160
THE INUGAMI-GYOBU-DANUKI

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:57.660
THE YOKAI BEAST

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:57.600
<i>"Wobble, wobble."</i>

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.790
Stop, Mana!

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:07.190
Mana...

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:10.940
Kitaro... Kitaro...

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:13.970
Help him!

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:20.890
I'm GeGeGe no Kitaro.

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:22.540
Hair Needles!

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:23.620
Kitaro!

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:26.480
808 Tanuki, give Mana back!

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:27.900
You did it!

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:29.190
Hold on!

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:30.610
Kitaro...

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:32.670
Mana.

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:48.670
Don't do it!

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:51.090
You'll be turned to stone too!

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:56.160
I thought you died...

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:57.930
Of course I ain't dead!

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:01.910
This is for usin' me as a loincloth!

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:46.980
Right! What about Kitaro?!

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.420
Thanks, Mana.

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:55.670
Kitaro...

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:58.390
You too, Catchick.

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:03.310
Kitaro, you really are
an idiot, aren't you?

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:06.730
Trying to break
the Kaname Stone without thinking...

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.080
Oh! You're all right!

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:26.500
More importantly, this place
won't last! Let's go!

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:28.390
I don't wanna get pinned here!

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:35.170
For all that big <i>tanuki</i> talk,
they went down pretty easily.

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:43.280
Curse you, Kitaro!
I shall have my revenge!

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:49.420
Where is this?

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:52.420
It seems to be the foot of Mt. Fuji.

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:54.150
Hey!

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:56.490
Everyone, you're all right.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.670
You destroyed the Kaname Stone?

00:14:58.670 --> 00:15:02.240
Yes. It's all thanks to Mana-chan.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:04.580
That's not...

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:19.380
Kitaro!

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:23.450
It's the vengeful spirit of Gyobu-Danuki.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:28.750
You've made yourself a slave of the humans
and thwarted our plans.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:31.350
You won't escape my wrath!

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:46.160
But, we destroyed the Kaname Stone.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:49.580
Gyobu-Danuki's wrath is controlling it.

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:51.460
Rollo Cloth!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:52.790
Ya got it!

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:03.660
A-whoosh!

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:06.350
Whoops!

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:21.760
-Oh no!
-A-whoa...

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:31.790
<i>Kitaro!</i>

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:42.470
Cat-san, what about Kitaro?!

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:44.590
He's all right!

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:49.430
Kitaro!

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:03.320
Here goes!

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:10.740
Finger Guns!

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:35.940
Now's our chance to run!

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:37.810
But, Kitaro is...!

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:46.530
I'll have to use the Sand Drum!

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:50.990
Don't! Use the Sand Drum again
and you'll...

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:53.500
If I don't, everyone will...!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:56.350
<i>Chinchinchinapaipo</i>

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:57.290
Rollo Cloth!

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:58.710
Cotton copies!

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:01.690
<i>Arichachinapapachina</i>

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:19.810
Kitaro! Hold on!

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:20.860
Kitaro!

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:22.480
Wake up!

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:24.650
Are you all okay?

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:27.360
Yeah. All thanks to you.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:28.240
That's good.

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:31.160
It ain't good at all! Look at that!

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:37.080
<i>Chinchinchina</i>

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:39.960
Don't push it. Your body won't hold.

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:42.060
Shut up, you drunk!

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:45.300
Everyone, get out of here.
I'll handle this.

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:46.300
But...

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:51.160
I have to stop it right here, or else.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:53.220
Dad, you should run, too!

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:54.680
Kitaro...

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:55.720
Kitaro.

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:57.850
Hurry and go!

00:18:57.850 --> 00:18:58.770
Listen!

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.670
Earlier, when I destroyed
the Kaname Stone...

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:07.950
That's probably the power
of the Kaname Stone.

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.950
It must have flowed into you, Mana-chan.

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:13.830
Then, if we use this, maybe...

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:16.450
But I can't drag you into th--

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:20.750
If we don't defeat it,
it will hurt everyone.

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:23.380
Mana, it'll be dangerous.

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:24.590
I know...

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:26.460
That's why...

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:29.650
promise me you'll win!

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:01.440
Finger Guns!

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:19.790
We did it!

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:30.740
The anti-<i>tanuki</i> people are stupid.

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:32.570
We are the chosen ones.

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:51.800
Mana!

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:59.140
Mana-chan saved us this time.

